gh, as I have always done, so also now I place myself in the hands of Your Paternity concerning going to the East Indies or else to the West, nevertheless — as I have also sometimes signified to Your Paternity — I "], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e500", "source": "letter:56", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Although, as I have always done, so also now I place myself in the hands of Your Paternity concerning going to the East Indies or else to the West, nevertheless — as I have also sometimes signified to Your Paternity — I "], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e501", "source": "letter:56", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e502", "source": "letter:56", "target": "topic:health", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e503", "source": "letter:56", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e504", "source": "letter:56", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e505", "source": "letter:56", "target": "place:rome", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["whence, having heard some time ago that Father Laerzio would soon be in Rome — [thinking] that he is already there — I have wished anew, with the resignation [."], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e506", "source": "letter:56", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e507", "source": "letter:56", "target": "person:gargano-francesco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e508", "source": "letter:56", "target": "place:salerno", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 56, "letter_url": "/letters/56/"}, {"id": "e509", "source": "letter:57", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["It is already three years since His Divine Majesty deigned to give me the vocation to enter the Society, and from that time He also gave me another, of no lesser worth — that of going to the Indies, to convert those soul"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e510", "source": "letter:57", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e511", "source": "letter:57", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e512", "source": "letter:57", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e513", "source": "letter:57", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e514", "source": "letter:57", "target": "person:cinami-leonardo", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e515", "source": "letter:57", "target": "place:naples", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 57, "letter_url": "/letters/57/"}, {"id": "e516", "source": "letter:58", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 58, "letter_url": "/letters/58/"}, {"id": "e517", "source": "letter:58", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 58, "letter_url": "/letters/58/"}, {"id": "e518", "source": "letter:58", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 58, "letter_url": "/letters/58/"}, {"id": "e519", "source": "letter:58", "target": "person:stella-marco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 58, "letter_url": "/letters/58/"}, {"id": "e520", "source": "letter:58", "target": "place:caltagirone", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 58, "letter_url": "/letters/58/"}, {"id": "e521", "source": "letter:59", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["On the occasion of the departure for Rome of Master Giovanni Scorso, my classmate, summoned by Your Paternity — as is believed, for the Indies — I have not wished to fail to write again to Your Paternity (as some days ag", "O sweet word, and to my ears most welcome, for which I would go even on foot all the way to the Indies, to follow my sweet Jesus, who sweetly invites me and comforts me with solid hope."], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e522", "source": "letter:59", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e523", "source": "letter:59", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e524", "source": "letter:59", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e525", "source": "letter:59", "target": "person:scorso-giovanni", "type": "mentions_person", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["On the occasion of the departure for Rome of Master Giovanni Scorso, my classmate, summoned by Your Paternity — as is believed, for the Indies — I have not wished to fail to write again to Your Paternity (as some days ag", "Master Giovanni Scorso will be able to tell Your Paternity the rest."], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e526", "source": "letter:59", "target": "place:rome", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["On the occasion of the departure for Rome of Master Giovanni Scorso, my classmate, summoned by Your Paternity — as is believed, for the Indies — I have not wished to fail to write again to Your Paternity (as some days ag"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e527", "source": "letter:59", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e528", "source": "letter:59", "target": "person:stella-marco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e529", "source": "letter:59", "target": "place:caltagirone", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 59, "letter_url": "/letters/59/"}, {"id": "e530", "source": "letter:60", "target": "place:ethiopia", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["At the news that has come here of the good harvest prepared in Ethiopia, where two hundred of ours are called, my ancient desire has been kindled further, and I have entered into hope that into that numerous [company] th"], "letter": 60, "letter_url": "/letters/60/"}, {"id": "e531", "source": "letter:60", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 60, "letter_url": "/letters/60/"}, {"id": "e532", "source": "letter:60", "target": "topic:other-missions", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 60, "letter_url": "/letters/60/"}, {"id": "e533", "source": "letter:60", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 60, "letter_url": "/letters/60/"}, {"id": "e534", "source": "letter:60", "target": "person:gargano-francesco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 60, "letter_url": "/letters/60/"}, {"id": "e535", "source": "letter:61", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Although I wrote to Your Paternity a few days ago with Father Giacomo Domenichi, Procurator of this Province, and that letter seemed as though it would have sufficed to remind Your Paternity of the fiery desire which, by"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e536", "source": "letter:61", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e537", "source": "letter:61", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e538", "source": "letter:61", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e539", "source": "letter:61", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e540", "source": "letter:61", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e541", "source": "letter:61", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["And if ever there was a time when I asked you this grace with fervor, this is that time, in which, with the coming of the Father Procurator of the Indies, many will be called to those blessed kingdoms — among whom I pray"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e542", "source": "letter:61", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e543", "source": "letter:61", "target": "person:stella-marco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e544", "source": "letter:61", "target": "place:messina", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 61, "letter_url": "/letters/61/"}, {"id": "e545", "source": "letter:62", "target": "topic:angels", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e546", "source": "letter:62", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e547", "source": "letter:62", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e548", "source": "letter:62", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e549", "source": "letter:62", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e550", "source": "letter:62", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e551", "source": "letter:62", "target": "person:balami-ignazio", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e552", "source": "letter:62", "target": "place:messina", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 62, "letter_url": "/letters/62/"}, {"id": "e553", "source": "letter:63", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I know well — and in the past I have always known — the unfitness I bear for so lofty a Vocation as this of the Indies;"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e554", "source": "letter:63", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e555", "source": "letter:63", "target": "topic:novitiate", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e556", "source": "letter:63", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e557", "source": "letter:63", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e558", "source": "letter:63", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e559", "source": "letter:63", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e560", "source": "letter:63", "target": "person:stella-marco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e561", "source": "letter:63", "target": "place:messina", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 63, "letter_url": "/letters/63/"}, {"id": "e562", "source": "letter:64", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Cast therefore at your feet, my most loving Father, with all possible affection I offer myself to you anew — wholly indifferent in all things, and in all things eager to apply myself as soon as possible to the labors of "], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e563", "source": "letter:64", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e564", "source": "letter:64", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e565", "source": "letter:64", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e566", "source": "letter:64", "target": "topic:martyrdom", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e567", "source": "letter:64", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e568", "source": "letter:64", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e569", "source": "letter:64", "target": "person:bartoli-daniello", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e570", "source": "letter:64", "target": "place:parma", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 64, "letter_url": "/letters/64/"}, {"id": "e571", "source": "letter:65", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Having heard that whoever desires to go to the Indies should now, there being a convenient occasion and need of men, make it known by giving a memorial — though in me I am certain (as my Superior can well know) that I ha"], "letter": 65, "letter_url": "/letters/65/"}, {"id": "e572", "source": "letter:65", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 65, "letter_url": "/letters/65/"}, {"id": "e573", "source": "letter:65", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 65, "letter_url": "/letters/65/"}, {"id": "e574", "source": "letter:65", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 65, "letter_url": "/letters/65/"}, {"id": "e575", "source": "letter:65", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 65, "letter_url": "/letters/65/"}, {"id": "e576", "source": "letter:65", "target": "person:bressani-francesco-giuseppe", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 65, "letter_url": "/letters/65/"}, {"id": "e577", "source": "letter:66", "target": "place:china", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["There is England, Japan, China, and so many other barbarous and heretical lands: may I too, least of all who ask you such a grace, find in so great a vastness some place where, according to my desire, I may spend my life"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e578", "source": "letter:66", "target": "place:england", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["There is England, Japan, China, and so many other barbarous and heretical lands: may I too, least of all who ask you such a grace, find in so great a vastness some place where, according to my desire, I may spend my life"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e579", "source": "letter:66", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["There is England, Japan, China, and so many other barbarous and heretical lands: may I too, least of all who ask you such a grace, find in so great a vastness some place where, according to my desire, I may spend my life"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e580", "source": "letter:66", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Behold me cast once more at your feet by the most ardent desire which, by His mercy, the Lord God gives me to amplify His Holy Name in aiding the infidels, and amid the greatest hardships and sufferings of persecutions."], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e581", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:china-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e582", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e583", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e584", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e585", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:martyrdom", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e586", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:other-missions", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e587", "source": "letter:66", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e588", "source": "letter:66", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e589", "source": "letter:66", "target": "person:bartoli-daniello", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e590", "source": "letter:66", "target": "place:parma", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 66, "letter_url": "/letters/66/"}, {"id": "e591", "source": "letter:67", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["My having up to now not manifested to Your Paternity my Vocation for the Indies was not because God has newly sent it to me — for since I asked to enter the Society I always asked with this intention — but by counsel of ", "Now at last, though unworthy, having been admitted to the first degree of the Society, and finding myself at the beginning of my studies — a Milanese by country, aged nineteen, a Humanist of two years in Letters — I have"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e592", "source": "letter:67", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e593", "source": "letter:67", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e594", "source": "letter:67", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e595", "source": "letter:67", "target": "topic:novitiate", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e596", "source": "letter:67", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e597", "source": "letter:67", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e598", "source": "letter:67", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e599", "source": "letter:67", "target": "person:vimercati-orazio", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e600", "source": "letter:67", "target": "place:genoa", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 67, "letter_url": "/letters/67/"}, {"id": "e601", "source": "letter:68", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I would not have had the boldness — considering my natural, spiritual, and moral unfitnesses, of weak health and little or no virtue — to propose to Your Most Reverend Paternity the desire which Our Lord God, on the occa"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e602", "source": "letter:68", "target": "topic:health", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e603", "source": "letter:68", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e604", "source": "letter:68", "target": "topic:xavier-st-francis", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e605", "source": "letter:68", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e606", "source": "letter:68", "target": "person:xavier-francis", "type": "mentions_person", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I would not have had the boldness — considering my natural, spiritual, and moral unfitnesses, of weak health and little or no virtue — to propose to Your Most Reverend Paternity the desire which Our Lord God, on the occa"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e607", "source": "letter:68", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e608", "source": "letter:68", "target": "person:bressani-francesco-giuseppe", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 68, "letter_url": "/letters/68/"}, {"id": "e609", "source": "letter:69", "target": "place:new-world", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["A long time ago I wrote to Your Paternity to remember me on occasions of sending men to the New World, to toil in something for the conversion of those peoples;"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e610", "source": "letter:69", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e611", "source": "letter:69", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e612", "source": "letter:69", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e613", "source": "letter:69", "target": "place:italy", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["Second my hopes, Your Paternity, and do not leave me idle in Italy, where with so much my shame so many departures of our Fathers are seen every day;"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e614", "source": "letter:69", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e615", "source": "letter:69", "target": "person:cinami-leonardo", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e616", "source": "letter:69", "target": "place:naples", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 69, "letter_url": "/letters/69/"}, {"id": "e617", "source": "letter:70", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Having already three times proposed to Your Paternity the desire which His Divine Majesty has deigned to give me for the Indies — and having, by my negligence and carelessness, not sought a response — now, so as not to h"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e618", "source": "letter:70", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e619", "source": "letter:70", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e620", "source": "letter:70", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e621", "source": "letter:70", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e622", "source": "letter:70", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e623", "source": "letter:70", "target": "person:bressani-francesco-giuseppe", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 70, "letter_url": "/letters/70/"}, {"id": "e624", "source": "letter:71", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["To these corporal favors He has added many spiritual ones through His infinite goodness, among which I count as great His having called and wanted me in the Company at the age of fourteen, and, by His most liberal grace "], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e625", "source": "letter:71", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["So great is the longing and desire that Our Lord has communicated to me to go and assist the souls who remain in the Indies, and to shed my blood for love of my Lord, who first shed His for me, that after having waited t"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e626", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e627", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e628", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:health", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e629", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e630", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e631", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:vows", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e632", "source": "letter:71", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e633", "source": "letter:71", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e634", "source": "letter:71", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e635", "source": "letter:71", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 71, "letter_url": "/letters/71/"}, {"id": "e636", "source": "letter:72", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["His Divine Majesty having, from the very beginning of my entrance, enkindled in my heart a lively and ardent desire to shed my blood in the Indies for His love, and having preserved it in me throughout all the time of my"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e637", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e638", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e639", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:novitiate", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e640", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e641", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:other-missions", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e642", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e643", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e644", "source": "letter:72", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e645", "source": "letter:72", "target": "place:ethiopia", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["now that I have been destined by holy Obedience to the study of Rhetoric, and with the occasion of the Father Procurator of Ethiopia who was here, and with the fervor of these brothers, I have judged (lest I seem ungrate"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e646", "source": "letter:72", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e647", "source": "letter:72", "target": "person:heredia-antonio", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e648", "source": "letter:72", "target": "place:massa", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 72, "letter_url": "/letters/72/"}, {"id": "e649", "source": "letter:73", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["A year ago I gave Your Paternity account of the desire which God our Lord communicated to me to spend my life and shed my blood for love of my Lord, and for the salvation of souls, in Japan;"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e650", "source": "letter:73", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e651", "source": "letter:73", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e652", "source": "letter:73", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e653", "source": "letter:73", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e654", "source": "letter:73", "target": "place:japan", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["for having dealt so intimately with a fellow student of mine stricken with the plague two days before his death, assisting him in everything, even to holding his forehead for a great while, while he burned all over with "], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e655", "source": "letter:73", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e656", "source": "letter:73", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e657", "source": "letter:73", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 73, "letter_url": "/letters/73/"}, {"id": "e658", "source": "letter:74", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I shall seem troublesome to Your Paternity for so often recalling to you the ardent longing communicated to me by the Lord to shed my blood in Japan for His love and for the salvation of souls.", "Everything seems nothing to me, and there is nothing that fully satisfies me, until the happy lot of going to Japan falls to me."], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e659", "source": "letter:74", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e660", "source": "letter:74", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e661", "source": "letter:74", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e662", "source": "letter:74", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e663", "source": "letter:74", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e664", "source": "letter:74", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e665", "source": "letter:74", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e666", "source": "letter:74", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 74, "letter_url": "/letters/74/"}, {"id": "e667", "source": "letter:75", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Some time ago I wrote to Your Paternity of the vocation to the Indies which Our Lord deigned, from the very beginning of my entrance into Religion, to give me, and of its effect I obtained good hope from Your Paternity.", "among which dangers, once finding myself in the public lazaretto with suspicion of the plague, I promised God that, if I came out safe, I would dedicate myself wholly to His service in the Indies, and to the Most Holy Vi"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e668", "source": "letter:75", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e669", "source": "letter:75", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e670", "source": "letter:75", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e671", "source": "letter:75", "target": "place:loreto", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["among which dangers, once finding myself in the public lazaretto with suspicion of the plague, I promised God that, if I came out safe, I would dedicate myself wholly to His service in the Indies, and to the Most Holy Vi"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e672", "source": "letter:75", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e673", "source": "letter:75", "target": "person:vimercati-orazio", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e674", "source": "letter:75", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 75, "letter_url": "/letters/75/"}, {"id": "e675", "source": "letter:76", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["The most ardent desire for the Indies, which by the infinite goodness of the Lord God continues ever greater in me, compels me to ask you for the grace thereof again, as I have done at other times, so now more than ever "], "letter": 76, "letter_url": "/letters/76/"}, {"id": "e676", "source": "letter:76", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 76, "letter_url": "/letters/76/"}, {"id": "e677", "source": "letter:76", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 76, "letter_url": "/letters/76/"}, {"id": "e678", "source": "letter:76", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 76, "letter_url": "/letters/76/"}, {"id": "e679", "source": "letter:76", "target": "person:bartoli-daniello", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 76, "letter_url": "/letters/76/"}, {"id": "e680", "source": "letter:76", "target": "place:parma", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 76, "letter_url": "/letters/76/"}, {"id": "e681", "source": "letter:77", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 77, "letter_url": "/letters/77/"}, {"id": "e682", "source": "letter:77", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 77, "letter_url": "/letters/77/"}, {"id": "e683", "source": "letter:77", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 77, "letter_url": "/letters/77/"}, {"id": "e684", "source": "letter:77", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 77, "letter_url": "/letters/77/"}, {"id": "e685", "source": "letter:77", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 77, "letter_url": "/letters/77/"}, {"id": "e686", "source": "letter:78", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["It seems to me now that the time has come to effectuate my so many times manifested desire to be once sent to the country so longed for by me, of the Indies."], "letter": 78, "letter_url": "/letters/78/"}, {"id": "e687", "source": "letter:78", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 78, "letter_url": "/letters/78/"}, {"id": "e688", "source": "letter:78", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 78, "letter_url": "/letters/78/"}, {"id": "e689", "source": "letter:78", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 78, "letter_url": "/letters/78/"}, {"id": "e690", "source": "letter:78", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 78, "letter_url": "/letters/78/"}, {"id": "e691", "source": "letter:79", "target": "place:china", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["be it Japan, England, China, the Mogul, or any other country."], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e692", "source": "letter:79", "target": "place:england", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["be it Japan, England, China, the Mogul, or any other country."], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e693", "source": "letter:79", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["be it Japan, England, China, the Mogul, or any other country."], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e694", "source": "letter:79", "target": "place:the-mogul", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["be it Japan, England, China, the Mogul, or any other country."], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e695", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e696", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:china-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e697", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e698", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e699", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e700", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:other-missions", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e701", "source": "letter:79", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e702", "source": "letter:79", "target": "place:peru", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["Now that the Father Procurator of Peru comes thither to supplicate Your Paternity also, among other things, that you grant him some of Ours for those countries;", "I do not pray you to send me to Peru, or to any other country by name, for I will never add a word that would take from me a total indifference and from Your Paternity a supreme liberty to dispose of me for whatever coun"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e703", "source": "letter:79", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e704", "source": "letter:79", "target": "person:bartoli-daniello", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e705", "source": "letter:79", "target": "place:parma", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 79, "letter_url": "/letters/79/"}, {"id": "e706", "source": "letter:80", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Your Paternity having, to my petition to go to the Indies, already twice answered that there was no occasion, since at that time there was no thought of sending laborers to those parts;", "nevertheless I hope in the grace of the Lord that, as by His goodness He has hitherto maintained in me the vocation to the Indies, so He may also give me sufficient strength to correspond to it, whenever it pleases Him t"], "letter": 80, "letter_url": "/letters/80/"}, {"id": "e707", "source": "letter:80", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 80, "letter_url": "/letters/80/"}, {"id": "e708", "source": "letter:80", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 80, "letter_url": "/letters/80/"}, {"id": "e709", "source": "letter:80", "target": "person:vimercati-orazio", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 80, "letter_url": "/letters/80/"}, {"id": "e710", "source": "letter:80", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 80, "letter_url": "/letters/80/"}, {"id": "e711", "source": "letter:81", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["The continual goad of my divine vocation, which ever urges me on, together with the kindness of Your Paternity shown me in other letters of yours, has given me the assurance to trouble you once again with my tedious lett"], "letter": 81, "letter_url": "/letters/81/"}, {"id": "e712", "source": "letter:81", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 81, "letter_url": "/letters/81/"}, {"id": "e713", "source": "letter:81", "target": "topic:vows", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 81, "letter_url": "/letters/81/"}, {"id": "e714", "source": "letter:81", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 81, "letter_url": "/letters/81/"}, {"id": "e715", "source": "letter:81", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 81, "letter_url": "/letters/81/"}, {"id": "e716", "source": "letter:81", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 81, "letter_url": "/letters/81/"}, {"id": "e717", "source": "letter:82", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["My inclination was from the first for Japan, but since I see the great difficulty there is in obtaining so great a mission, I offer myself to Your Paternity for that of Paraguay, and I await, with the coming of the Fathe"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e718", "source": "letter:82", "target": "place:paraguay", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["My inclination was from the first for Japan, but since I see the great difficulty there is in obtaining so great a mission, I offer myself to Your Paternity for that of Paraguay, and I await, with the coming of the Fathe"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e719", "source": "letter:82", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Since one of the causes that moved me rather to choose the religious state in the Company than in another order was the hope of obtaining one day from my superiors the mission of the Indies, and in particular of those pl"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e720", "source": "letter:82", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e721", "source": "letter:82", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e722", "source": "letter:82", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e723", "source": "letter:82", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e724", "source": "letter:82", "target": "topic:paraguay-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e725", "source": "letter:82", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e726", "source": "letter:82", "target": "person:archinto-alessandro", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e727", "source": "letter:82", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 82, "letter_url": "/letters/82/"}, {"id": "e728", "source": "letter:83", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I have always had a great desire to help, as much as I can with the grace of His Divine Majesty, the souls of men, with the desire to go to the Indies;", "and therefore, by the bowels of Jesus Christ and of His most holy Mother, I supplicate with all my heart Your Paternity to place me in the roll of those who go to the Indies, so that I may one day lay down this miserable"], "letter": 83, "letter_url": "/letters/83/"}, {"id": "e729", "source": "letter:83", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 83, "letter_url": "/letters/83/"}, {"id": "e730", "source": "letter:83", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 83, "letter_url": "/letters/83/"}, {"id": "e731", "source": "letter:83", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 83, "letter_url": "/letters/83/"}, {"id": "e732", "source": "letter:83", "target": "person:taverna-francesco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 83, "letter_url": "/letters/83/"}, {"id": "e733", "source": "letter:84", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 84, "letter_url": "/letters/84/"}, {"id": "e734", "source": "letter:84", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 84, "letter_url": "/letters/84/"}, {"id": "e735", "source": "letter:84", "target": "person:magaglianes", "type": "mentions_person", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I spoke this morning with Father Magaglianes, who with his great charity much enlarged my heart, assuring me that I would obtain from Your Paternity whatever I knew how to ask in this matter.", "I have recourse therefore to Your Paternity with all confidence, begging you that — since this vocation has now for many years been detained and nourished by me as no small sign of the divine will, and since such good he"], "letter": 84, "letter_url": "/letters/84/"}, {"id": "e736", "source": "letter:84", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 84, "letter_url": "/letters/84/"}, {"id": "e737", "source": "letter:84", "target": "person:archinto-gabriele", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 84, "letter_url": "/letters/84/"}, {"id": "e738", "source": "letter:84", "target": "place:milan", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 84, "letter_url": "/letters/84/"}, {"id": "e739", "source": "letter:85", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I have consoled all this year my desire with the hope of the arrival there of the Father Procurator of Cochin, to whom Your Paternity promised Father Antonio Magaglianes to give me as companion for the mission of the Ind", "Do not delay, for the love of God, to a later occasion to do me the grace, but from this hour give what remains of my life wholly to the holy Apostle Xavier and consecrate it to the good of the Indies;"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e740", "source": "letter:85", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e741", "source": "letter:85", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e742", "source": "letter:85", "target": "topic:xavier-st-francis", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e743", "source": "letter:85", "target": "person:magaglianes", "type": "mentions_person", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I have consoled all this year my desire with the hope of the arrival there of the Father Procurator of Cochin, to whom Your Paternity promised Father Antonio Magaglianes to give me as companion for the mission of the Ind"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e744", "source": "letter:85", "target": "person:xavier-francis", "type": "mentions_person", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["Now that he has arrived, here I am, after so many other times, prostrate anew at your feet, where with all the affection of my soul, for the love of the holy Father Xavier, I supplicate you to console at last my desire t", "Do not delay, for the love of God, to a later occasion to do me the grace, but from this hour give what remains of my life wholly to the holy Apostle Xavier and consecrate it to the good of the Indies;"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e745", "source": "letter:85", "target": "place:cochin", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I have consoled all this year my desire with the hope of the arrival there of the Father Procurator of Cochin, to whom Your Paternity promised Father Antonio Magaglianes to give me as companion for the mission of the Ind"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e746", "source": "letter:85", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e747", "source": "letter:85", "target": "person:bartoli-daniello", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e748", "source": "letter:85", "target": "place:parma", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 85, "letter_url": "/letters/85/"}, {"id": "e749", "source": "letter:86", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["and even so, that I may not further occupy Your Paternity, occupied as you are with so many other things, I add only that daily the affection toward that place warms and inflames ever more, and the Indies stand almost co"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e750", "source": "letter:86", "target": "topic:health", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e751", "source": "letter:86", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e752", "source": "letter:86", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e753", "source": "letter:86", "target": "place:rome", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I have tried also some little mission in the squares of Rome and at Frascati, as a prelude to the great ones;"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e754", "source": "letter:86", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e755", "source": "letter:86", "target": "person:serafini-fortunato", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 86, "letter_url": "/letters/86/"}, {"id": "e756", "source": "letter:87", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["As I never feel my lukewarmness more kindled than when that holy desire is revived in me which, against all my merit, the Holy Spirit kindled in my heart — as I have always believed — for the holy mission of the Indies, "], "letter": 87, "letter_url": "/letters/87/"}, {"id": "e757", "source": "letter:87", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 87, "letter_url": "/letters/87/"}, {"id": "e758", "source": "letter:87", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 87, "letter_url": "/letters/87/"}, {"id": "e759", "source": "letter:87", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 87, "letter_url": "/letters/87/"}, {"id": "e760", "source": "letter:87", "target": "person:bressani-francesco-giuseppe", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 87, "letter_url": "/letters/87/"}, {"id": "e761", "source": "letter:88", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["There is not yet extinguished amid the ice of my so many failings that little warmth with which the Lord kindled my heart when He gave me the holy desire of the Indies."], "letter": 88, "letter_url": "/letters/88/"}, {"id": "e762", "source": "letter:88", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 88, "letter_url": "/letters/88/"}, {"id": "e763", "source": "letter:88", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 88, "letter_url": "/letters/88/"}, {"id": "e764", "source": "letter:88", "target": "person:bressani-francesco-giuseppe", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 88, "letter_url": "/letters/88/"}, {"id": "e765", "source": "letter:89", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["It is a wonder with what joys my soul has been inflamed since you recently, by your letters, stirred in me the expectation of an Indian expedition;"], "letter": 89, "letter_url": "/letters/89/"}, {"id": "e766", "source": "letter:89", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 89, "letter_url": "/letters/89/"}, {"id": "e767", "source": "letter:89", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 89, "letter_url": "/letters/89/"}, {"id": "e768", "source": "letter:89", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 89, "letter_url": "/letters/89/"}, {"id": "e769", "source": "letter:89", "target": "person:finechiaro-mario", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 89, "letter_url": "/letters/89/"}, {"id": "e770", "source": "letter:89", "target": "place:caltanissetta", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 89, "letter_url": "/letters/89/"}, {"id": "e771", "source": "letter:90", "target": "place:east-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["It is many years since I wrote to Your Paternity, asking you as a grace to destine me to the mission of the East Indies;"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e772", "source": "letter:90", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I therefore cast myself at your feet, and most humbly pray you, with all the affection I can and with all the force I know how, that you will make me set sail for the Indies as soon as may be;"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e773", "source": "letter:90", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e774", "source": "letter:90", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e775", "source": "letter:90", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e776", "source": "letter:90", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e777", "source": "letter:90", "target": "person:cinami-leonardo", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e778", "source": "letter:90", "target": "place:st-illegible", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 90, "letter_url": "/letters/90/"}, {"id": "e779", "source": "letter:91", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["For although You keep me as Your intermediary in every place, yet set beside the Indian regions all things grow cheap to me;"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e780", "source": "letter:91", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e781", "source": "letter:91", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e782", "source": "letter:91", "target": "topic:vows", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e783", "source": "letter:91", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["Since the flames of my ardor for the Indian enterprise are doubled in me more and more each day, I feel myself sweetly and unceasingly pricked to write to You again with greater care;"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e784", "source": "letter:91", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e785", "source": "letter:91", "target": "person:finechiaro-mario", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e786", "source": "letter:91", "target": "place:caltanissetta", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 91, "letter_url": "/letters/91/"}, {"id": "e787", "source": "letter:92", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["The great desire, which Our Lord in His infinite mercy deigns to communicate to me, to go to the Indies, compels me to trouble Your Paternity with this letter."], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e788", "source": "letter:92", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e789", "source": "letter:92", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e790", "source": "letter:92", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e791", "source": "letter:92", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e792", "source": "letter:92", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e793", "source": "letter:92", "target": "person:cinami-leonardo", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e794", "source": "letter:92", "target": "place:naples", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 92, "letter_url": "/letters/92/"}, {"id": "e795", "source": "letter:93", "target": "place:india", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I, the least of all men, ardently desire to be sent to India."], "letter": 93, "letter_url": "/letters/93/"}, {"id": "e796", "source": "letter:93", "target": "place:india", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I, the least of all men, ardently desire to be sent to India."], "letter": 93, "letter_url": "/letters/93/"}, {"id": "e797", "source": "letter:93", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 93, "letter_url": "/letters/93/"}, {"id": "e798", "source": "letter:93", "target": "person:demstero-francesco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 93, "letter_url": "/letters/93/"}, {"id": "e799", "source": "letter:93", "target": "place:spoleto", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 93, "letter_url": "/letters/93/"}, {"id": "e800", "source": "letter:94", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["wherefore I can do nothing else but weep for my faults, which doubtless accuse me before the Divine countenance as most unworthy of so abundant a grace as the Mission of the Indies and suffering for Christ."], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e801", "source": "letter:94", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e802", "source": "letter:94", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e803", "source": "letter:94", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e804", "source": "letter:94", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e805", "source": "letter:94", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e806", "source": "letter:94", "target": "person:finechiaro-mario", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e807", "source": "letter:94", "target": "place:palermo", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 94, "letter_url": "/letters/94/"}, {"id": "e808", "source": "letter:95", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["My Father, the desire that the Lord kindled in me for the Mission of the Indies has grown so great that I hope the same Lord, with His Most Holy Mother, will move Your Paternity to console me;"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e809", "source": "letter:95", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e810", "source": "letter:95", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e811", "source": "letter:95", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e812", "source": "letter:95", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e813", "source": "letter:95", "target": "person:finechiaro-mario", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e814", "source": "letter:95", "target": "place:mineo", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 95, "letter_url": "/letters/95/"}, {"id": "e815", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Index of Topics: 'Japan, mission to' (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e816", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I dare to say this because night and day I do nothing but penances and prayers to this end, and not only I, but countless others make prayers and penances for me, to move first God and then the heart of Your Paternity to", "Reckon, Your Paternity, that there is no moment when I do not run to the Indies in thought;"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e817", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:heaven-hell-and-purgatory", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e818", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e819", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e820", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:martyrdom", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e821", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e822", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e823", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:vows", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e824", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:xavier-st-francis", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e825", "source": "letter:96", "target": "topic:zeal-for-souls", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e826", "source": "letter:96", "target": "person:xavier-francis", "type": "mentions_person", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["Let Your Paternity make me follow God, who will have me at all costs, and be moved by those tears which I cannot show you, but which I shed continually for this grace before Saint Francis Xavier."], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e827", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:asia", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["In short, God has lifted me out of myself and out of Europe, and makes me dwell only in Asia among barbarians and infidels."], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e828", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:europe", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["In short, God has lifted me out of myself and out of Europe, and makes me dwell only in Asia among barbarians and infidels."], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e829", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:japan", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I never close my eyes without dreaming of Japan, or the Ocean, or martyrdoms."], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e830", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:rome", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I believe this letter of mine will have the fortune of finding Your Paternity in Rome, and I rejoice that it comes into your hands together with the others, so that they may strike a greater blow and obtain from Your Pat"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e831", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["In short, God has lifted me out of myself and out of Europe, and makes me dwell only in Asia among barbarians and infidels."], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e832", "source": "letter:96", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e833", "source": "letter:96", "target": "person:cinami-leonardo", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e834", "source": "letter:96", "target": "place:naples", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 96, "letter_url": "/letters/96/"}, {"id": "e835", "source": "letter:97", "target": "place:india", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I, the vilest of mortals, have nothing in hope, desire, expectation, or love, except to be sent to India."], "letter": 97, "letter_url": "/letters/97/"}, {"id": "e836", "source": "letter:97", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 97, "letter_url": "/letters/97/"}, {"id": "e837", "source": "letter:97", "target": "place:india", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["I, the vilest of mortals, have nothing in hope, desire, expectation, or love, except to be sent to India."], "letter": 97, "letter_url": "/letters/97/"}, {"id": "e838", "source": "letter:97", "targe